{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "label": "Phase 0 Research Log (D1-D12 decisions)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d1_rename_item_decision", "label": "D1 - Rename with Rename-Item, never copy-and-delete", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rename-Item preserves file, content and attributes and is auditable; a pre-check prevents silent overwrite and ascending numeric order avoids confusion between names sharing a prefix. git mv was rejected because the process must not run git outside hooks; copy-and-delete was rejected for loss and temp-file risk."}, {"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d2_reference_vs_normative_boundary", "label": "D2 - Boundary Between Textual Reference and Normative Content", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Without an explicit boundary a broad replacement could alter rules, schema or domain examples, while skipping the six files would leave the rules citing names the index no longer uses; so only the name token is substituted and punctuation, tables, links and the rest of the sentence stay."}, {"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d3_single_manifest_decision", "label": "D3 - Single Rename and Reference Manifest", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With one folder, six files and references spread over README, procedure, fixtures and eight suites, a single manifest prevents divergent substitutions and allows scope review before editing; global substitution without a manifest was rejected for hitting historical specs and non-referential contexts."}, {"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d6_legacy_redirect_decision", "label": "D6 - Legacy Redirect Preserved", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Feature 006 kept the old entry-point path so earlier specs keep working; renaming it would break that compatibility and creating redirects for the six files would widen scope with no entry point to justify it."}, {"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d7_suite_update_strategy", "label": "D7 - Suites Updated Per Phase plus New Contract Suite", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existing suites read fixed paths, so without phased updates the build fails before it can validate the feature; updating everything at the end would leave intermediate phases without a green build, and manual review alone would not fail the build."}, {"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d8_packaged_artifact_gate", "label": "D8 - target/classes as Gate, Installed JAR Opt-In", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The build already packages src/main/resources into target/classes and existing suites read that copy; the installed JAR depends on mvn install and a clean environment, and the spec never defined it as an acceptance gate."}, {"id": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d12_exact_names_collision", "label": "D12 - Exact Names, Collision Abort, Case-Insensitive Filesystems", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The spec forbids overwrite and demands exact names, so destination absence is pre-checked and the first collision aborts the phase; spaces or accents are rejected because the target is exactly 03-regras-de-formacao-do-contrato."}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d1_rename_item_decision", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d2_reference_vs_normative_boundary", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d3_single_manifest_decision", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d6_legacy_redirect_decision", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d7_suite_update_strategy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d8_packaged_artifact_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d12_exact_names_collision", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_research_log", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_spec_feature_specification", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d3_single_manifest_decision", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_contracts_rename_manifest_rename_manifest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/011-rename-contract-rule-files/research.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_research_d3_single_manifest_decision", "target": "specs_011_rename_contract_rule_files_contracts_rename_manifest_reference_inventory", "relation": "conceptually_rela